# AtCoder Library Practice Contest C - Floor Sum
# https://atcoder.jp/contests/practice2/tasks/practice2_c

Kalivisku musope kas floor_sum vis n kasta m kasta a kasta b {
    Sonome kas answer tas 0.
    Sonome kas y_max tas 0.
    Sonome kas old_m tas 0.

    Pilike palusta Tuni {
        Palusta a >= m {
            answer += (n - 1) * n * (a // m) // 2.
            a %= m.
        }
        Palusta b >= m {
            answer += n * (b // m).
            b %= m.
        }

        Kemese kas y_max tas a * n + b.
        Palusta y_max < m {
            Kinise.
        }

        Kemese kas n tas y_max // m.
        Kemese kas b tas y_max % m.
        Kemese kas old_m tas m.
        Kemese kas m tas a.
        Kemese kas a tas old_m.
    }

    Jasepe kas answer.
}

Sonome kas T tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas query tas [0, 0, 0, 0].

Pilike kas i pas Kisite kas pilika vis T {
    Kemese kas query tas Kisite kas readints vis 4.
    Takute kas Kisite kas floor_sum vis query[0] kasta query[1] kasta query[2] kasta query[3].
}
